[OC]|cffffffffThe Witherbark cages|r  -  south-east of Aerie Peak. West village: Witherbark Scalpers 40-41 and Zealots 41-42 at 22-25,55-60; east village: Hideskinners 42-43 and Venombloods 43 at 28-33,57-62; none elite. Every Witherbark kill can drop a Troll Tribal Necklace (~25-43%). Witch Doctor Ti'ik (level 49) stands just south of the west village (25-26,63-66): keep clear of him
Check the First and Second Witherbark Cages in the west village [QC2988,1] [QC2988,2] [G23.2,58.8 The Hinterlands]
