At [TAR5634 Rhapsody Shindigger], [QT1452] (3,600 XP) [QA1469 Rhapsody's Tale] (2,700 XP at Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind - chapter 49) [G26.9,48.6 The Hinterlands]
